líticas de conformidade integradas a pipelines de CI/CD&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Automação de implantação&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Monitoramento&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Recuperação de desastres e alta disponibilidade&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; outline-color: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; list-style: disc;&quot;&gt;Gerenciamento de pacotes e contêineres&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
