        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j20HJ7eK7HWvUlV44Z0k-2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;" value="-&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Introducing MLOps&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;How to Scale Machine Learning in the Enterprise. Editora O&#39;Reilly&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pratical MLops. Editora O&#39;Reilly&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;- https://www.databricks.com/learn/training/lakehouse-fundamentals-accreditation#videocomp (Curso e Certificado Databricks)&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://docs.microsoft.com/pt-br/azure/databricks/applications/machine-learning/automl#modify-the-dataset (Auto ML)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://learn.microsoft.com/pt-br/azure/architecture/solution-ideas/articles/azure-databricks-data-science-machine-learning (CD Databricks)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://learn.microsoft.com/pt-br/azure/databricks/applications/machine-learning/ (ML Databricks)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/databricks/applications/mlflow/tracking (Tracking MLflow)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://learn.microsoft.com/pt-br/azure/databricks/applications/mlflow/end-to-end-example (Exemplo end to end ML Databricks)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://learn.microsoft.com/pt-br/azure/databricks/applications/machine-learning/feature-store/workflow-overview-and-notebook?source=recommendations (Workflow Datbricks)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://learn.microsoft.com/pt-br/azure/databricks/applications/mlflow/?source=recommendations (mlflow)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;- https://www.mlflow.org/docs/latest/tracking.html (MLflow)&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-https://docs.google.com/document/d/1459uvXQGPz6qTRqrC7sBtnQJCUAOqv5ZH-CDh_9pdEo/edit&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;(Bambolib Databricks)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;https://towardsdatascience.com/what-is-feature-engineering-importance-tools-and-techniques-for-machine-learning-2080b0269f10 (feature engineerring)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://pt.linkedin.com/pulse/ml-feature-selection-eduardo-domingues (Feature Selection)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stepwise_regression&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(Feature Selection)&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp; https://quantifyinghealth.com/stepwise-selection/&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(Feature Selection)&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- https://towardsdatascience.com/stopping-stepwise-why-stepwise-selection-is-bad-and-what-you-should-use-instead-90818b3f52df&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(Feature Selection)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://dataml.com.br/como-escolher-as-melhores-features-para-um-modelo-de-aprendizado-de-maquina/&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(Feature Selection)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://paulovasconcellos.com.br/como-selecionar-as-melhores-features-para-seu-modelo-de-machine-learning-2e9df83d062a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(Feature Selection)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/classes.html#module-sklearn.feature_selection&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(Feature Selection)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;-https://proximonivel.embratel.com.br/3-dicas-para-utilizar-o-machine-learning-sem-comprometer-os-dados-dos-usuarios/&amp;nbsp; (Governança)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-https://www.anoreg.org.br/site/artigo-potenciais-efeitos-da-lgpd-no-uso-de-aplicacoes-de-inteligencia-artificial-por-lukas-ruthes-goncalves/&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(Governança)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;- http://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2015-2018/2018/lei/l13709.htm (LGPD, Artigo&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-indent: 35px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial&quot; size=&quot;2&quot;&gt;8º, Governança)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://h2o-release.s3.amazonaws.com/h2o/rel-wheeler/4/docs-website/h2o-docs/cloud-integration/databricks.html&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial; font-size: small; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35px;&quot;&gt;(AutoML)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-indent: 35px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial&quot; size=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- https://towardsdatascience.com/automated-machine-learning-with-h2o-258a2f3a203f (AutoML)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;https://christophm.github.io/interpretable-ml-book/preface-by-the-author.html (Machine Learning)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp; https://scikit-learn.org/stable/tutorial/machine_learning_map/ (Machine Learning)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://scientistcafe.com/2017/07/08/machinelearningal&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Machine Learning)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://towardsdatascience.com/all-machine-learning-algorithms-you-should-know-in-2022-db5b4ccdf32f (Machine Learning)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- https://learn.microsoft.com/pt-br/azure/machine-learning/algorithm-cheat-sheet&lt;br&gt;- https://learn.microsoft.com/pt-br/azure/machine-learning/how-to-select-algorithms&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/u/0/open?id=1M_aYQDE_YN4RICGFPR-lnR_oaHZr1WReAhrYPzYiteI&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; aria-label=